New regtest readme

General structure of the new regression test infrastructure is a call of this 
nature: 

python /home/cew/Code/fudge2014/Regression_tests/new_regtest_infrastructure/run_fudge_regression_tests.py -i /home/cew/Code/testing/test_script.txt --regtest

Where /home/cew/Code/testing/test_script.txt is an input file containing the absolute path to one XML per line. 

There are several arguments that should be set by the script, but are currently hard-coded into the body of the wrapper, for testing purposes. Work on that later.

A
